      "description": "RAF Brüggen 6 August 1985.\nRoyal Air Force Station Brüggen, part of Royal Air Force Germany (RAFG), was a very busy place, with up to four squadrons of front line, nuclear-capable ground-attack fighter-bombers.  Spotting 30 different 'numbers' a day was nothing special, with each jet flying two sorties.\n\nZD745 is still active (as of 2015).",
