      "filename": "Jaguar GR1 17sq (24192130524).jpg",
      "title": "File:Jaguar GR1 17sq (24192130524).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/Jaguar_GR1_17sq_%2824192130524%29.jpg",
